DBarkalo@world.std.com (Daniel J Barkalow) writes:

>I have a suggestion for the dev team which they could do in a minute or 
>two (I think): Change the order you give information about your 
>character. I'm sick of making up names before I find out what kind of 
>character I will be. I like to let the game choose, but I'd like to name 
>myself accordingly.

You mean at startup? Not possible. When you pick a name, the game
checks if there is a game in progress under that name, and only if
there isn't, you get to pick a class. So the game NEEDS to know your
name to decide if it will let you pick a class at all.

A possiblity would be that you had an option of changing your name just
after you picked a class, but this would add another (not necessary)
question at game start that I personally wouldn't like.

